41:["$","p","91",{"className":"text-[#839BBE] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["❌ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#F0F2FE]","children":"Weaknesses:"}]," Only 15 global regions, no bare metal, no Windows support, Premium Droplets are pricey for what you get on a per-GB-RAM basis."]}]
