43:["$","p","94",{"className":"text-[#839BBE] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#F0F2FE]","children":"Strengths:"}]," Best storage I/O for database workloads, Akamai-backed security infrastructure (free 1Tbps DDoS protection), most developer-friendly API and CLI, NodeBalancers are excellent value."]}]
44:["$","p","95",{"className":"text-[#839BBE] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["❌ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#F0F2FE]","children":"Weaknesses:"}]," Limited to 16 regions, no bare metal, no PaaS/serverless offering, StackScripts ecosystem is less active than DigitalOcean’s community tutorials."]}]
